1
00:02:08,395 --> 00:02:21,065
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,399
Kill them!

3
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:40,999
Aim! Shoot!

4
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:11,319
Praise be.

5
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:18,519
-My Bey has escaped, thank Allah.
-Thank Allah.

6
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:23,479
However, not only my Osman
Bey. Holofira also escaped.

7
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:29,119
Alps, we will go to the meeting
point before soldiers arrive.

8
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:34,719
Catch them!

9
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:58,199
Son, stop standing around. Come, sit.

10
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:00,919
Didn't you say that Gonca is alright?

11
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:04,279
She is alright, however, only for now.

12
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:07,559
If his father and house keep
on feeding their anger like this..

13
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:11,439
-..how will my Gonca be alright?
-We will all be with you, brother.

14
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:15,079
-She will be alright.
-I hope so.

15
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:21,678
-Alaeddin!
-My Gonca.

16
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:24,039
My baby.

17
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:27,439
Our baby is alright.

18
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:30,839
Are you alright? You scared us.

19
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:34,319
Thank Allah.

20
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:39,079
My Allah, thank you. My father.

21
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:42,119
Is my father alright?
Mother, is my father alright?

22
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:45,959
He is alright, my daughter.
However, he hasn't woke up yet.

23
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,559
You will look after yourself from now on, Hatun.

24
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:52,999
You will be careful for
both yourself and our baby.

25
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:55,999
No tiring yourself and getting upset.

26
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:58,199
How can I prevent it, Alaeddin.

27
00:04:58,280 --> 00:05:00,479
Even if I prevent my tongue..

28
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:04,119
..I can not prevent my heart.

29
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:09,479
So, that is how children are.

30
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:12,239
When you become a mother and a father..

31
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,839
..you only live for your children.

32
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,329
Right.

33
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:22,799
How does my father hold on?

34
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:25,919
My father’s anger does not go away.

35
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,959
It is a hard burden to bear.

36
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:31,039
He is like this because he misses you.

37
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:34,279
He acts stubborn, however..

38
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:38,079
He does not give it up, does he?

39
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:44,039
-Are we allowed?
-Come in.

40
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:51,079
Sister.

41
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:54,359
Are you alright?

42
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:57,359
You scared me.

43
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:02,999
I am alright, brother.

44
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:06,559
-My father- -He is sleeping.

45
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:10,239
You be alright.

46
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:31,039
I wish none of this had happened.

47
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:35,239
But it did.

48
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:42,319
Anyways, you have some
rest. I'll check on my father.

49
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:56,479
Come on, have some rest.

50
00:06:57,360 --> 00:07:00,279
Come on, my daughter.

51
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:04,119
Alaeddin.

52
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:08,159
If my brother softened up,
maybe my father will forgive me.

53
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:11,759
I hope so, my rose, my Gonca.

54
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:15,559
Then, after my father wakes up..

55
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:18,119
..I will tell him time of marriage.

56
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:23,559
After my father gets up, then
we will make marriage, right?

57
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:28,039
Of course we will.

58
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:11,759
-We did good with bows, valiants.
-Thank Allah.

59
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:15,479
Did you see how my Bey
smacked that dog down?

60
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:22,799
If that dog didn't have thick
armor, it would've ended there.

61
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,479
My Bey is coming!

62
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:34,719
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too, my Bey.

63
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,958
My Bey, thank Allah you are here.

64
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:40,279
-Are you alright?
-I am alright.

65
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,198
Thank Allah.

66
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:45,959
I hope our Allah who united us will
grant us victory as well.

67
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:48,759
If Allah permits, my Bey.

68
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:53,559
What will we do now, my Bey?
Are we heading back home?

69
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:57,599
No, we will not.

70
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:02,159
On the contrary, we will make
every land we step on our home.

71
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:06,119
-If Allah permits, my Bey.
-So, my Bey..

72
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:10,039
You showed him well.

73
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:15,679
Yes.

74
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:20,039
Now, since we won't come
back, Konstantin will be on our tail.

75
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,879
He will hunt us.

76
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:27,839
We will show him who really is the hunter.

77
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:31,359
Until we have his head..

78
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:35,439
-..there is no going back.
-As you command, my Bey.

79
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:38,479
Now, Gocers and Yoruks.

80
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:40,999
We will stand by them.

81
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:44,799
We will make them settle. So that..

82
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:48,879
..Bursa and Iznik shall be the land of Turks.

83
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:51,999
If Allah permits.

84
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:55,079
Come on. Solgur Agha..

85
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:59,239
..must've had the tribe
settled. Let us go to him.

86
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:03,959
My Bey. You put yourself in danger for Holofira.

87
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:08,359
-May you prosper.
-Holofira is like my daughter.

88
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:13,439
Her heart is like of our Baciyans.
He put herself in danger for us.

89
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:15,959
And we won't hold back giving our life for her..

90
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:20,319
..when the time comes.
-Thank you, my Bey.

91
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:25,359
Now, she gained trust in Konstantin's eyes..

92
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:28,079
..by falling to the trap knowingly.

93
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:32,039
That is why, Tugay and Husrev
will get information from Holofira.

94
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:37,839
Come on alps, we are leaving.

95
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:45,959
I am ready to leave, my Shahzade,
however, you haven't told me where.

96
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:50,559
You will go to Bursa, Kanyumaz.

97
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:55,319
This here says that Holofira is Osman's spy.

98
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:59,919
You will give this to Commander Konstantin.

99
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:03,479
A spy?

100
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:08,239
They'll kill Holofira Hatun, my Shahzade.

101
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,959
And we'll be blamed for this.

102
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:13,159
-They'll know what I want them to know.
-How?

103
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,199
I wrote...

104
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:19,439
...the letter in the name of a
woman who hates Holofira.

105
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,999
Elcim Hatun.

106
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:26,159
Yes, Elcim.

107
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:32,519
I didn't write her name in
the letter. But everybody...

108
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:37,119
...even Constantin will
think it was written by Elcim.

109
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:40,519
Nobody will blame us, Kanyumaz.

110
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:44,999
We'll damage Osman and his family in this way.

111
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:46,719
Come on.

112
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:49,959
Deliver the letter as soon as possible.

113
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:52,839
Don't get yourself exposed.

114
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:57,119
As you order, my Shahzade.

115
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:49,879
-Peace be upon you!
-Peace be upon you too, Osman Bey!

116
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:51,919
Praise be. Praise be.

117
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:54,719
You've finished the half of the tribe together!

118
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:57,999
-My Bey, welcome to my tribe.
-Thank you.

119
00:12:58,040 --> 00:13:01,439
Our soldiers are working without resting.

120
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:05,279
They wanted to stop to
welcome you, but I didn't let.

121
00:13:05,280 --> 00:13:08,399
I wanted to prepare our tribe first.

122
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:09,639
Thank you.

123
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:11,879
Duty comes first.

124
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:14,599
Thank you, Solgur Agha. Well...

125
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:19,559
We'll work without rest so
we will lose as least as we can.

126
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:21,759
-Welcome, my Bey.
-Welcome, my Bey.

127
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:24,079
Thank you, thank you.

128
00:13:24,680 --> 00:13:28,359
-May your work be easy! Praise be!
-Thank you!

129
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:31,759
-Thank you.
-Aameen.

130
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:39,039
-Well...
-My Bey.

131
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:42,959
I'll get the fattest goat in
my tribe slaughtered for you.

132
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:46,839
Great Solgur Agha will get only one slaughtered?

133
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:49,639
I will get ten goats slaughtered!

134
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:53,039
Hey, calm down. Don't slaughter animals in vain.

135
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:58,319
Well, my Bey... Osman Bey has
ebme to my tribe with his warriors.

136
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,239
Not ten.

137
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:02,279
Twenty goats!

138
00:14:03,280 --> 00:14:06,279
Well, I'll go pick mine then.

139
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:09,959
I can pick the best from
the baa sound, you know.

140
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:10,988
Come here!

141
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:13,999
A guest should eat what
he's offered, Cerkutay Bey.

142
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:17,679
Nothing can run away from
my brother, my Shahzade.

143
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:22,359
Well, Solgur Agha... One
for the alps, one for Cerkutay.

144
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,639
As you order, my Bey.

145
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:27,199
Yes! I got one!

146
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:39,679
Alaeddin, tell me.

147
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:42,839
Is my father alright? Don't
hide anything from me.

148
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:45,519
Be patient, Mehmed.

149
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:48,679
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

150
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:51,759
Come on, Yakup Bey.

151
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:55,999
Wake up already. Come on.

152
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:04,239
Son, how is he doing?

153
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:07,199
His breath is good, mother.

154
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:11,679
-He'll regain strength as he rests, I hope.
-I hope so.

155
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:16,439
-Father.
-My Gonca.

156
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:18,959
Father?

157
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:23,559
Why did you leave the bed?

158
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:26,599
I just couldn't wait, Alaaddin.

159
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:31,839
-Let me sit with my father.
I promise I won't tire myself. -Fine.

160
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:36,839
Sister, Alaaddin is right.

161
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:41,639
-You should rest.
I'm fine, brother. I'll stay with father.

162
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:47,399
Well... Why is my father
still sleeping, Alaaddin?

163
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:50,479
Don't be afraid, dear. It's
because of healing herbs.

164
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:53,267
They'll help him have a
nice sleep and regain strength.

165
00:15:53,279 --> 00:15:54,199
Yes.

166
00:15:58,200 --> 00:16:01,399
My daughter... My daughter.

167
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:06,319
-My daughter.
-Father.

168
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:11,439
My daughter. Gonca...

169
00:16:11,640 --> 00:16:16,199
Father.
I'm here, father.

170
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:19,359
I'm with you, father.
I'm here.

171
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:22,639
I'm here with you, father.

172
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:25,719
-Gonca.
-Father.

173
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,199
Father...

174
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:31,679
I miss you so much, father.

175
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:34,839
I miss you so much.

176
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:38,359
I miss you calling me daughter.

177
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:43,119
I miss you saying "my Gonca" to me, father.

178
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:48,039
Father... Father.

179
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:50,999
Please wake father.

180
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:54,359
Please wake up. Wake up, father.

181
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:58,359
Call me daughter again,
please. Open your eyes, father.

182
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,359
Wake up.

183
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:03,759
Have you forgiven me?

184
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:07,479
-Father, please.
-My daughter...

185
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:12,079
-My Gonca.
-Father.

186
00:17:56,080 --> 00:18:00,079
Holofira...
My dear cousin..

187
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:06,039
You did a great job.
We found Osman on the road you said.

188
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:10,879
But we lost him, for now.
-That's not an issue for us.

189
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:13,719
Orhan is still in love with me.

190
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:16,559
He will come to Bursa again for me.

191
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:20,759
This time, we will not miss that
opportunity. I will rip the hearts of...

192
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:24,359
...Orhan and Osman.

193
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:27,679
I don't want you to go to the
monastery for some more time.

194
00:18:27,760 --> 00:18:29,999
You will keep serving us.

195
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:32,999
If they are going to die in the end...

196
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:36,639
...I'd be happy to do it, Konstantin.

197
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:45,879
Have the Emperor's ships set sail, Commander?

198
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:48,799
The ships set sail, sir.

199
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,999
Our soldiers are ready to
enter the Yalikova harbour.

200
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:55,279
We will set out in the morning.

201
00:18:55,360 --> 00:19:00,079
We will be on the road at dawn, Commander!

202
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:15,519
Holofira!

203
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:30,759
You proved that you are an
honourable member of Paleolugus family.

204
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:38,439
This i$an honor that will last me a lifetime.

205
00:19:46,800 --> 00:19:51,159
Dastard... shameless...

206
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:54,919
Just like her father! She..

207
00:19:55,240 --> 00:20:00,639
...betrayed us and
Byzantium. She deceived me.

208
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:06,119
Who sent us this unsigned letter?

209
00:20:06,520 --> 00:20:08,119
A woman in pain..

210
00:20:08,800 --> 00:20:12,079
...who is disturbed by
Orhan's past with Holofira.

211
00:20:12,160 --> 00:20:14,959
A woman who is jealous of her.

212
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:17,759
Elcim Hatun.

213
00:20:19,520 --> 00:20:22,559
Holofira heard what she needed to hear.

214
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:24,839
Osman.

215
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:28,119
...will fall into our trap tomorrow.

216
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:32,319
Andrea will follow Holofira.

217
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:36,119
I will keep using her until I get rid of Osman.

218
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:43,799
Until... the day that I will strangle her comes.

219
00:20:56,040 --> 00:21:00,759
The taxes that we will send to the
Constantinople are ready, Commander Konstantin.

220
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:05,319
These golds are vital for the
army the Emperor will establish.

221
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:09,079
Take the golds out of the city
silently from beneath the walls.

222
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:10,839
Get lost!

223
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:41,039
Brothers! Brothers! What
are you doing without me?

224
00:21:43,320 --> 00:21:48,559
You are cooking my goat.

225
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:52,599
My goat...

226
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:57,559
This is my goat!

227
00:21:57,960 --> 00:22:02,079
This is my goat... -Brother...

228
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:07,239
A wolf took your goat, Cerkutay.

229
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:13,799
My... -Solgur Agha...

230
00:22:13,880 --> 00:22:16,399
...had set aside the biggest one for you, but...

231
00:22:16,560 --> 00:22:18,359
Yes...

232
00:22:21,600 --> 00:22:26,479
Only a wolf and you have
that appetite, Cerkutay Bey...

233
00:22:27,080 --> 00:22:30,919
A wolf took my big goat..

234
00:22:31,840 --> 00:22:36,159
Brother... You see, your goat...

235
00:22:36,360 --> 00:22:39,199
..fled towards the mountain.

236
00:22:39,520 --> 00:22:42,439
My goat is gone.

237
00:22:42,840 --> 00:22:46,399
What am I going to do now?

238
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:50,759
Now this is...

239
00:22:53,280 --> 00:22:55,999
...your share, brother.

240
00:22:56,800 --> 00:23:00,119
This?

241
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:02,799
What am I going to die?
I'm going to die of hunger.

242
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:05,999
What am I going to do?
I'm going to die of hunger.

243
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:10,439
I am going to die of sorrow.
What am I going to do?

244
00:23:10,600 --> 00:23:14,359
What am I going to do, brothers?

245
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:19,159
Where should we put Cerkutay Bey's goat?

246
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:26,279
My brother!

247
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:31,439
My goat is here!
My goat is here!

248
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:35,799
Now I will go and put my goat on the table...

249
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:40,039
There are people who are jealous of my goat!

250
00:23:43,360 --> 00:23:45,002
It is halal to you, enjoy it.

251
00:23:45,014 --> 00:23:46,439
Thank you, Solgur Agha.

252
00:23:46,560 --> 00:23:49,199
Come on then.
Let's not keep our Bey waiting.

253
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:06,959
-May it heal, my Bey.
-Thank you.

254
00:24:08,920 --> 00:24:15,119
-Enjoy, my Bey.
-Thank you, thank you.

255
00:24:44,480 --> 00:24:49,679
Yoruks' fate is migrating again.

256
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:53,399
The tribes in the East are
now migrating to the west.

257
00:24:53,760 --> 00:24:57,359
Tell me, Konur, how many
tribes have we established?

258
00:24:57,440 --> 00:25:00,119
My Bey, there were a total of 24 tribes.

259
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:04,039
Ten of them, including this one,
have reached their destination.

260
00:25:04,120 --> 00:25:06,799
The rest are still on the way.

261
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:11,399
They are on the way, but they are in danger.

262
00:25:11,520 --> 00:25:16,879
Constantine will now be waiting
for an opportunity to attack them.

263
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:22,519
That's why we must always be ready.

264
00:25:23,880 --> 00:25:26,959
Once again, we are at the
borders as we used to be.

265
00:25:27,280 --> 00:25:30,199
We face the enemy hand-to-hand.

266
00:25:30,560 --> 00:25:33,079
Whenever we face them hand-to-hand...

267
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:37,239
...we become stronger, my Bey. It
will be the same again, if Allah permits.

268
00:25:37,320 --> 00:25:41,959
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

269
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:49,199
My Bey, as long as that Constantine dog lives
we will always be dealing with this trouble.

270
00:25:49,280 --> 00:25:52,639
They have sent soldiers
from Constantinople and Iznik.

271
00:25:52,640 --> 00:25:55,039
Right, right.
But...

272
00:25:55,040 --> 00:25:58,039
We will always be ready.

273
00:25:58,120 --> 00:26:00,519
We will know every move they make.

274
00:26:00,680 --> 00:26:04,399
We will always be after them, don't worry.

275
00:26:08,600 --> 00:26:11,599
Come on then, everyone is hungry.

276
00:26:11,800 --> 00:26:14,519
Cerkutay is also hungry, look at him.

277
00:26:14,600 --> 00:26:18,799
-Isn't that right, Cerkutay? You're hungry.
-I am not, my Bey.

278
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:24,159
Alright then, let me tell you a long story.

279
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:31,719
What happened, Cerkutay?

280
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:37,999
Anyway, let's not give him a heart failure.

281
00:26:38,520 --> 00:26:42,439
Come on, Cerkutay, start eating.

282
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:46,199
Enjoy your meals, Beys. You can eat now.

283
00:26:56,200 --> 00:27:00,999
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

284
00:27:17,040 --> 00:27:19,879
Cerkutay... Brother...

285
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:23,519
Eat a little slower you'll choke.

286
00:27:24,520 --> 00:27:27,759
You should not be afraid of
men who eat, Boran brother!

287
00:27:27,840 --> 00:27:32,719
You should not be afraid of men who eat,
you should be afraid of men who do not eat.

288
00:27:33,800 --> 00:27:38,079
Men who do not eat are
sick. Men who do not eat...

289
00:27:38,240 --> 00:27:42,319
...are weak.
Men who do not eat are low.

290
00:27:50,920 --> 00:27:54,959
Brother... When are we going
to organize your wedding?

291
00:27:55,080 --> 00:27:58,279
The weather has warmed up as well.

292
00:27:58,320 --> 00:28:01,079
Right...
Fatma is right.

293
00:28:01,160 --> 00:28:04,079
Once Yakup Bey recovers...

294
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:06,919
...and Osman Bey and Orhan return...

295
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:09,319
...we will organize your wedding.

296
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:14,239
We talked about that this morning.
Let's wait for Yakup Bey to recover...

297
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:18,719
We don't know if my
father is going to forgive us.

298
00:28:18,920 --> 00:28:20,999
Let's organize your wedding!

299
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:24,079
I will defeat you in the competition
of carrying sheep, Shahzade!

300
00:28:24,080 --> 00:28:27,079
You will see. -Do you hear him?

301
00:28:27,560 --> 00:28:30,519
We know the winner of that competition, Ghazi.

302
00:28:30,760 --> 00:28:35,959
Do not tire yourself.
-Is that what you think?

303
00:28:36,080 --> 00:28:39,439
You had enough. I need strength!

304
00:28:39,560 --> 00:28:41,919
I swear,
I will defeat you.

305
00:28:42,160 --> 00:28:44,679
Come on then, eat.

306
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:49,999
How is Yakup Bey?

307
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:56,119
I believe he will be alright once he
recover, Elcim Hatun.

308
00:28:56,560 --> 00:29:02,399
I hope so. If there is
something that I can do...

309
00:29:02,520 --> 00:29:05,559
...Gonca...
-No, Elcim.

310
00:29:05,640 --> 00:29:09,159
Gonca...
Forgive me for...

311
00:29:09,240 --> 00:29:11,039
...what I said about your father.

312
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:15,199
I said all those things because of my anger.

313
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:20,399
I will go and take food to my brother. Enjoy.

314
00:29:23,920 --> 00:29:27,999
She is worried about her father,
Elcim Hatun. Do not misunderstand her.

315
00:29:28,120 --> 00:29:32,439
No, she is right. I made a mistake.

316
00:29:33,080 --> 00:29:39,039
I kept saying bad words...
Then Yakup Bey got sick.

317
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:46,279
Those things might happen,
my daughter. We are a family.

318
00:29:46,360 --> 00:29:48,399
We may fight and get offended...

319
00:29:48,680 --> 00:29:53,439
...but we come together at
the same table and make peace.

320
00:31:31,440 --> 00:31:36,239
Constantine is going to Yalikova.
He will set out in the morning.

321
00:32:03,080 --> 00:32:07,239
Constantine will set out in the
morning. He will go to Yalikova.

322
00:32:07,560 --> 00:32:09,999
I will go and inform Osman Bey now.

323
00:32:10,120 --> 00:32:13,679
You will stay here and
keep doing your duty, Husrev.

324
00:32:38,560 --> 00:32:41,519
My Bey...

325
00:32:42,240 --> 00:32:45,159
If you accept... a dagger sheath.

326
00:32:45,440 --> 00:32:48,759
I made it with my own hands, my Bey.

327
00:32:54,040 --> 00:32:56,679
It is beautiful.

328
00:32:57,680 --> 00:33:03,799
But... this is not just a sheath..

329
00:33:07,800 --> 00:33:12,159
There are some little secrets on this, huh?

330
00:33:12,800 --> 00:33:17,479
Alright, alright.

331
00:33:18,880 --> 00:33:21,919
I hope you won't need it my Bey, but...

332
00:33:22,160 --> 00:33:25,199
...I made it just in case you
might need it in the future.

333
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:29,999
Thank you.
I will carry it proudly.

334
00:33:30,080 --> 00:33:33,239
-Thank you my Bey.
-Live long.

335
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:39,639
May it bring you blessings,
my Bey. Thank you, cerkutay.

336
00:33:39,880 --> 00:33:42,359
I didn't want to say it, but...

337
00:33:42,680 --> 00:33:46,559
How did you bring that
Constantine dog off his horse?

338
00:33:46,760 --> 00:33:50,999
The man fell and rolled like a falling egg.

339
00:33:55,080 --> 00:33:58,959
But he didn't crack. It
will also happen if Allah permits.

340
00:33:59,040 --> 00:34:00,879
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

341
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:07,799
But this move will make
Constantine even more angry, my Bey.

342
00:34:07,840 --> 00:34:10,239
He was disgraced before his soldiers.

343
00:34:10,840 --> 00:34:13,679
Orhan Bey is right.

344
00:34:14,280 --> 00:34:19,559
Constantine is different than the others.

345
00:34:19,960 --> 00:34:23,359
His mind works differently.

346
00:34:23,639 --> 00:34:27,679
Thus, he will want to take his revenge.

347
00:34:30,679 --> 00:34:33,585
Thanks for the blessings
my Allah granted us with...

348
00:34:33,598 --> 00:34:34,918
Aameen. Thanks to Him.

349
00:34:35,199 --> 00:34:39,638
Thanks to Him... Or else,
how would we feed this priest?

350
00:34:41,600 --> 00:34:44,759
He was a talented priest,
my Bey. He showed the way...

351
00:34:45,080 --> 00:34:47,319
..to heaven to that poor man.

352
00:34:49,320 --> 00:34:53,159
My Bey... Don't, please.
They are already making fun of me.

353
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:59,239
They keep asking me "How are we
going to go to heaven, Priest Efendi?"

354
00:34:59,560 --> 00:35:03,039
No, stop! Baysungur told me everything.

355
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:09,039
Right Baysungur? Come on!
Tell us, what did Cerkutay say?

356
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:34,319
Look for God on the ground. Go ahead.

357
00:35:34,640 --> 00:35:39,239
Then you will find heaven.

358
00:35:40,680 --> 00:35:43,879
Yes, you will. Look for God, son.

359
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:48,439
I didn't do like this, my
Bey. He's making up a story.

360
00:35:48,560 --> 00:35:51,559
You felt at home in Bursa.

361
00:35:53,640 --> 00:35:56,759
It was for the duty, my Bey.

362
00:35:57,120 --> 00:36:00,159
What did you say?

363
00:36:01,080 --> 00:36:06,559
Well... Well...
A man came to me.

364
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:09,719
And he asked how to go to heaven.

365
00:36:10,640 --> 00:36:14,959
"Go straight. How can I know
everything? I said and he went away.

366
00:36:17,520 --> 00:36:21,959
You told him the shortest way
Cerkutay. Praise be to you!

367
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:24,479
-Boran.
-My Bey.

368
00:36:24,560 --> 00:36:27,119
I haven't listened to your kopuz for long.

369
00:36:27,360 --> 00:36:31,719
-Do you have new lyrics?
-Sure, my Bey.

370
00:36:32,600 --> 00:36:36,199
I composed one recently.

371
00:36:37,360 --> 00:36:40,399
Play your kopuz. So...

372
00:36:40,560 --> 00:36:43,199
...our lights will be cheered!

373
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:46,319
As my Bey orders.

374
00:37:04,480 --> 00:37:19,639
A warrior comes forward to fight!

375
00:37:20,840 --> 00:37:36,599
He is called Osman the Brunet!

376
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:51,239
Fighting for jihad!

377
00:37:51,280 --> 00:37:58,799
Fine warriors stand with you.

378
00:37:59,800 --> 00:38:08,359
Those harming the
innocent shall die soon.

379
00:38:08,680 --> 00:38:15,959
The whole world shall
learn about the order, we will teach.

380
00:38:21,840 --> 00:38:27,759
Heart shall burn!
The innocents shall find cure!

381
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:34,719
Heart shall burn!
Arrows shall hit the target!

382
00:38:35,120 --> 00:38:43,999
Mountains shall thunder!

383
00:38:44,240 --> 00:38:50,679
Heart shall burn!
The innocents shall find cure.

384
00:38:50,960 --> 00:38:57,399
Heart shall burn!
Arrows shall hit the target!

385
00:38:57,840 --> 00:39:09,359
Mountains shall thunder!

386
00:39:40,480 --> 00:39:56,319
Once Bey of Beys wages war...

387
00:39:57,320 --> 00:40:12,159
Once brave warriors let out a yell...

388
00:40:17,320 --> 00:40:24,839
Kneel, the cruel!
Your heads will fall.

389
00:40:25,040 --> 00:40:33,239
All the innocent shall rejoice!
Their screams shall be ended!

390
00:40:33,600 --> 00:40:41,519
All the domes shall find freedom.

391
00:40:41,960 --> 00:40:50,079
The whole world shall
learn about the order, we will teach.

392
00:40:55,080 --> 00:41:01,679
Heart shall burn!
The inncocents shall find cure!

393
00:41:01,880 --> 00:41:07,719
Heart shall burn!
Arrows shall hit the target!

394
00:41:08,360 --> 00:41:17,879
Mountains shall thunder!

395
00:41:18,080 --> 00:41:24,079
Heart shall burn!
The inncocents shall find cure!

396
00:41:24,360 --> 00:41:30,559
Heart shall burn!
Arrows shall hit the target!

397
00:41:30,880 --> 00:41:41,039
Mountains shall thunder!

398
00:41:50,200 --> 00:41:54,159
Praise be! Well sung!

399
00:41:54,880 --> 00:41:58,479
Thank you, my Bey! Long live you!

400
00:41:59,160 --> 00:42:03,959
We'll reach every target with
and behind you, if Allah permits.

401
00:42:04,040 --> 00:42:06,799
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

402
00:42:07,560 --> 00:42:13,439
Our target is The Red Apple.
With Allah's will, we'll reach it.

403
00:42:13,880 --> 00:42:15,359
If Allah permist, my Bey.

404
00:42:15,400 --> 00:42:19,759
-If Allah permits, my Bey.
-If Allah permits.

405
00:42:56,160 --> 00:42:59,799
What are you doing here?

406
00:43:16,800 --> 00:43:20,919
Kanyumaz, what are you doing in Bursa?

407
00:43:21,440 --> 00:43:24,279
Didn't Osman Bey forbid Germiyans?

408
00:43:24,440 --> 00:43:28,559
Husrev, Osman’s leashed dog.

409
00:43:29,040 --> 00:43:33,679
-Are you a spy now?
-I can become anything for my nation.

410
00:43:34,040 --> 00:43:36,399
What about you?

411
00:43:36,640 --> 00:43:41,679
You can only dig people's
graves for your own interests.

412
00:43:42,120 --> 00:43:46,679
-Tell me. What are you doing here?
-What am I doing?

413
00:43:47,040 --> 00:43:52,079
I will tell you but after
I take your filthy life!

414
00:43:52,880 --> 00:43:56,999
You made a mistake by confronting me, Husrev.

415
00:43:57,560 --> 00:44:02,479
Nobody should know I was here.

416
00:44:02,720 --> 00:44:05,319
This way, come on!

417
00:44:45,160 --> 00:44:48,319
Praise be!

418
00:44:48,560 --> 00:44:52,559
Stir, Aykut! Stir!

419
00:45:00,080 --> 00:45:06,319
This is a treasure. Marrow.

420
00:45:11,960 --> 00:45:16,879
This can resurrect the dead!

421
00:45:17,520 --> 00:45:20,399
And this here..

422
00:45:20,520 --> 00:45:24,119
..is marrow soup!

423
00:45:31,960 --> 00:45:35,359
Praise be.

424
00:45:39,360 --> 00:45:43,719
A little thyme..

425
00:45:46,800 --> 00:45:50,799
..a litle peppermint..

426
00:45:53,080 --> 00:45:58,239
..and now it is delicious.

427
00:46:03,920 --> 00:46:08,039
So you're saying we will be able
to climb walls after drinking this?

428
00:46:08,120 --> 00:46:11,559
You will fly!

429
00:46:16,640 --> 00:46:21,399
Tugay is coming. He wouldn't
have if it wasn't important.

430
00:46:21,960 --> 00:46:24,399
We need to be cautious.
Aykut.

431
00:46:24,640 --> 00:46:28,519
Cerkutay Bey, come on.

432
00:46:31,560 --> 00:46:35,519
The soup. Let me!

433
00:46:35,680 --> 00:46:38,559
-Let me take a spoon at least!
-Come on, Cerkutay Bey.

434
00:46:38,720 --> 00:46:41,239
A spoonful!

435
00:46:41,920 --> 00:46:48,319
-Just a spoonful Baysungur!
-Now it is all mine.

436
00:46:50,360 --> 00:46:53,199
We are protecting the
routes from all sides, my Bey.

437
00:46:53,600 --> 00:46:56,759
There are soldiers protecting the area ahead.

438
00:46:57,120 --> 00:47:01,039
If an attack comes from one side,
they will let us now with a signal.

439
00:47:01,200 --> 00:47:04,759
The others will then go to support.

440
00:47:05,120 --> 00:47:09,799
Yoruks and alps are ready to ready.

441
00:47:10,520 --> 00:47:14,839
You are talking about our moves.
What about what the enemy is doing?

442
00:47:14,920 --> 00:47:18,839
Iznik and all castles are being
watched by our scout alps, my Bey.

443
00:47:18,920 --> 00:47:21,839
We are ready at Bursa as well.

444
00:47:21,920 --> 00:47:24,519
Then, tell Aykurt..

445
00:47:24,600 --> 00:47:27,879
..to check all of our preparations.
-Thank you, my Bey.

446
00:47:36,280 --> 00:47:38,639
-My Bey.
-What is it, Tugay?

447
00:47:39,000 --> 00:47:41,479
We got information from Holofira, my Bey.

448
00:47:41,640 --> 00:47:44,999
Konstantin is on his way to Yalakova.

449
00:47:45,280 --> 00:47:49,639
There are support ships
coming from Constantinople.

450
00:47:51,320 --> 00:47:55,399
Tell alps to be ready. You will come with us.

451
00:47:55,720 --> 00:47:58,599
Alright, my Bey.

452
00:47:58,960 --> 00:48:04,919
Konstantin. Yalakova will be your grave.

453
00:48:23,000 --> 00:48:25,719
Wake up, father.

454
00:48:25,880 --> 00:48:28,439
Open your eyes, father.

455
00:48:29,240 --> 00:48:32,959
Tell me you forgive me.

456
00:48:33,320 --> 00:48:36,039
Please, father.

457
00:48:37,080 --> 00:48:39,999
Father, I am very tired.

458
00:48:42,400 --> 00:48:47,479
I didn't know this would
weigh this much to my heart.

459
00:48:51,560 --> 00:48:55,199
Now I am having a baby.

460
00:48:55,840 --> 00:48:58,399
I will be a mother.

461
00:48:59,840 --> 00:49:02,439
Now I understand.

462
00:49:03,920 --> 00:49:06,519
Father, I understand your pain now.

463
00:49:06,760 --> 00:49:11,119
Please forgive me.
Forgive me.

464
00:49:14,720 --> 00:49:19,439
Father.

465
00:49:19,760 --> 00:49:22,319
-Gonca?
-Father, you woke up!

466
00:49:22,440 --> 00:49:24,279
You woke up!

467
00:49:24,360 --> 00:49:27,079
My father! Brother!

468
00:49:27,160 --> 00:49:29,439
-Father has awoken!
-Father.

469
00:49:29,520 --> 00:49:32,639
-Father!
-Father!

470
00:49:33,480 --> 00:49:36,599
My father!

471
00:49:37,240 --> 00:49:41,239
-I am alright.
-So you healed, father.

472
00:49:42,000 --> 00:49:48,119
-Mehmed, where am I?
-At Osman's tribe.

473
00:49:57,120 --> 00:50:00,359
What am I doing in here?

474
00:50:01,240 --> 00:50:04,039
What am I doing in here Mehmed?

475
00:50:05,240 --> 00:50:08,159
You got sick, father.

476
00:50:09,680 --> 00:50:12,479
My brother brought you here.

477
00:50:13,040 --> 00:50:15,959
Alaeddin healed you.

478
00:50:19,240 --> 00:50:21,719
Father.

479
00:50:22,360 --> 00:50:24,719
Father, I know.

480
00:50:24,800 --> 00:50:30,119
It is a burden to your heart
as much as it is to mine.

481
00:50:31,520 --> 00:50:36,319
Forgive me.
Let this late morning end.

482
00:50:39,480 --> 00:50:41,439
I haven't did my wedding yet.

483
00:50:42,040 --> 00:50:48,159
I waited for you to heal.
Allah is my witness, I did.

484
00:50:51,600 --> 00:50:55,719
-Father.
-Father.

485
00:50:58,840 --> 00:51:02,879
Good news coming from you can not be good.

486
00:51:13,280 --> 00:51:16,399
You waited you say.

487
00:51:16,960 --> 00:51:20,959
Since you loved your father that much..

488
00:51:21,680 --> 00:51:24,159
..where was your mind?

489
00:51:27,000 --> 00:51:31,399
Gonca is not to blame,
father. It was all because of me.

490
00:51:31,800 --> 00:51:35,079
I had no other choice but to bring you here.

491
00:51:38,880 --> 00:51:42,079
Gonca is not alright, father.

492
00:51:42,640 --> 00:51:48,039
She almost lost her baby because
of how upset she got about you.

493
00:51:53,800 --> 00:51:58,319
-Father.
-Father.

494
00:52:07,760 --> 00:52:10,959
Take me to the marketplace.

495
00:52:12,800 --> 00:52:16,239
I will make h...

496
00:52:18,920 --> 00:52:22,039
Father, don't be stubborn, sit down.

497
00:52:22,120 --> 00:52:26,239
Father, please. You have to rest.

498
00:52:26,400 --> 00:52:29,719
Alaeddin told us to wait.

499
00:52:29,800 --> 00:52:32,399
Being in debt..

500
00:52:32,480 --> 00:52:36,319
..is making me weaker.

501
00:52:36,720 --> 00:52:41,439
Mehmed. Make your preparations.

502
00:52:41,960 --> 00:52:47,519
-We are leaving here tomorrow.
-As you command, father.

503
00:53:03,280 --> 00:53:07,479
My Bey. Konstantin's soldiers are coming.

504
00:53:07,880 --> 00:53:13,199
Come on then. It is time to
have Gunduz Bey's revenge.

505
00:54:50,920 --> 00:54:53,559
It is a trap, he is not Konstentin.

506
00:54:53,720 --> 00:54:57,159
It seems they knew we were
coming. Someone snitched.

507
00:54:57,240 --> 00:55:00,399
-They blocked the road, my Bey.
-Since there is no way..

508
00:55:00,640 --> 00:55:05,399
..then we will make one.

509
00:55:24,600 --> 00:55:27,799
Today, you die, Osman.

510
00:55:28,120 --> 00:55:30,439
You were saying the field of truth.

511
00:55:30,600 --> 00:55:34,039
I brought you the truth.

512
00:55:34,120 --> 00:55:38,479
-You will die.
-Truth lies at the end of my blade!

513
00:55:38,880 --> 00:55:44,119
And it knows who to kill well.

514
00:55:45,080 --> 00:55:49,359
Alps, they are many. This will be tough.

515
00:55:50,080 --> 00:55:52,039
Take formations!

516
00:57:29,320 --> 00:57:33,319
Alps! Stand still, we will get out!

517
00:57:45,080 --> 00:57:48,799
Hold on!

518
00:57:49,000 --> 00:57:51,599
-Protect Osman Bey!
-Shut it, Boran!

519
00:57:51,720 --> 00:57:56,079
I haven't died yet!

520
00:57:57,480 --> 00:58:00,719
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

521
00:58:00,880 --> 00:58:04,919
In the name of the cause!
Allah is the greatest!

522
00:58:22,880 --> 00:58:26,759
Mercy has caused trouble, Aleksios.
We should have killed you in the tribe.

523
00:58:26,800 --> 00:58:31,719
Don't you wonder how you
fell into the trap today, Orhan?

524
00:58:32,360 --> 00:58:36,679
It was a letter from the tribe
that told us about your plan.

525
00:58:37,440 --> 00:58:41,759
Someone who knows the great love
between you and Holofira and envies.

526
00:58:41,840 --> 00:58:44,679
Who can it be Orhan?

527
00:58:46,120 --> 00:58:48,959
-Don't you have a guess, Orhan?
-Shut up!

528
00:58:49,080 --> 00:58:52,799
You inglorious dastard, come here.

529
00:59:34,920 --> 00:59:39,479
Osman Bey isn't on his own! Attack!

530
00:59:40,080 --> 00:59:45,519
It's time to fight for Osman Bey! Strike, alps!

531
01:00:02,680 --> 01:00:07,679
Osman!
I'll be back!

532
01:00:10,840 --> 01:00:15,199
Constantin... Where are you going?

533
01:00:18,400 --> 01:00:21,759
I couldn't take even one spoon
from the soup because of you!

534
01:00:21,880 --> 01:00:25,199
Killing even a thousand of you won't satisfy me!

535
01:01:00,640 --> 01:01:03,759
You will never stop doing vile things, right?

536
01:01:18,720 --> 01:01:22,959
Come here, dastards!

537
01:02:43,200 --> 01:02:46,839
One way or another I'll bury
you in this forest, Constantin.

538
01:02:46,840 --> 01:02:48,599
Come, Osman.

539
01:02:48,800 --> 01:02:50,999
We'll see whose grave this place is.

540
01:02:51,080 --> 01:02:53,999
Attack!

541
01:03:08,320 --> 01:03:13,439
My Bey! My Bey! Where is Osman Bey, alps?

542
01:03:13,880 --> 01:03:16,319
Where is our Bey, Boran?

543
01:03:16,320 --> 01:03:19,399
He must have gone after that dog, brother.

544
01:03:25,560 --> 01:03:28,799
We should go catch up! Come on!

545
01:03:33,240 --> 01:03:35,439
Come here!

546
01:03:35,720 --> 01:03:39,999
-Where did those dastards come from?
-They want to stop us.

547
01:03:40,520 --> 01:03:44,079
Alps, our Bey is in danger.

548
01:03:44,160 --> 01:03:48,399
We should break through them quickly!

549
01:03:49,040 --> 01:03:53,799
-Here we go. Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

550
01:04:10,320 --> 01:04:13,519
Welcome to your death Osman!

551
01:04:14,200 --> 01:04:17,759
Everybody will talk about my victory.

552
01:04:18,080 --> 01:04:22,479
Magnificent
Constantin Paleologus...

553
01:04:22,640 --> 01:04:27,759
...slaughtered Osman, the cruel
leader of Osman, with his bare hands!

554
01:04:28,160 --> 01:04:31,919
In the end, you will be on the ground.

555
01:04:32,040 --> 01:04:35,799
-And I will keep standing.
-We don't...

556
01:04:36,320 --> 01:04:39,279
...fight to be remembered.

557
01:04:39,720 --> 01:04:44,639
Many anonymous warriors
sacrificed their blood for these lands.

558
01:04:45,200 --> 01:04:48,079
Neither you nor me..

559
01:04:48,400 --> 01:04:52,839
What matters is who will keep standing.

560
01:04:53,080 --> 01:04:57,439
Byzantine or the glorious state of Turks!

561
01:04:57,480 --> 01:05:02,119
Ancient Rome will always prevail in these lands.

562
01:05:02,320 --> 01:05:07,479
But you won't live long
enough to see those days.

563
01:05:08,480 --> 01:05:11,159
Archers!

564
01:05:28,040 --> 01:05:33,359
You turn the field of bravery into
the field of vileness again, huh?

565
01:05:33,920 --> 01:05:39,039
Bravery... Vileness... These
are just empty words, Osman.

566
01:05:39,680 --> 01:05:42,839
Only the winning write history.

567
01:05:43,280 --> 01:05:45,119
You say so?

568
01:07:23,400 --> 01:07:28,959
We'll follow the river to the end!
I'll make sure he's dead! Let's go!

569
01:07:44,280 --> 01:07:47,399
Baysungur.
-My Shahzade...

570
01:07:47,560 --> 01:07:51,159
Go to the tribe now.
Holofira's life is in danger.

571
01:07:51,240 --> 01:07:55,239
That dog named Alexios said that...

572
01:07:55,440 --> 01:07:59,999
...a Hatun from our tribe
informed them about Holofira.

573
01:08:01,440 --> 01:08:05,839
Is this why we fell into their trap
my Shahzade? But who did this?

574
01:08:06,280 --> 01:08:11,119
According to what that dog said...

575
01:08:13,320 --> 01:08:16,359
...Elcim Hatun did this.

576
01:08:16,520 --> 01:08:20,319
My Shahzade, how did this happen?
-Go to the tribe now.

577
01:08:20,520 --> 01:08:24,514
My Bala mother do what
is necessary. Go now.

578
01:08:24,526 --> 01:08:26,038
Yes my Shahzade.

579
01:08:27,319 --> 01:08:29,679
My Shahzade. Did something bad happen?

580
01:08:29,880 --> 01:08:33,639
What did Alexius tell you?
-That dog was just barking, Konur Bey.

581
01:08:33,880 --> 01:08:39,959
It's not important. Alps! We
will go after my father. Come on!

582
01:09:14,439 --> 01:09:20,639
The river must've swallowed Osman’s
dead body already. Check everywhere!

583
01:09:21,000 --> 01:09:23,479
Commander Constantine..

584
01:09:23,640 --> 01:09:27,439
Osman's Alps are looking for him.
We cannot stay here. Let's go back.

585
01:09:27,520 --> 01:09:31,759
Besides, you are injured.
Sooner or later, we wjll find them.

586
01:09:31,840 --> 01:09:34,959
I want Osman's dead body, Alexios!

587
01:09:35,040 --> 01:09:38,639
No one will leave until we find him!

588
01:09:38,800 --> 01:09:41,999
We will find Osman dead or alive.

589
01:09:42,080 --> 01:09:45,439
But... if his Alps come here
this might not be possible.

590
01:09:45,520 --> 01:09:51,198
Besides... there are just a few of us and you
are injured. Doctors must treat your wound.

591
01:09:54,920 --> 01:09:58,999
Osman! Neither your dead body...

592
01:09:59,080 --> 01:10:02,799
...nor your living body will escape from me!

593
01:10:03,040 --> 01:10:07,519
No one will return to the
city until you find Osman!

594
01:10:07,680 --> 01:10:13,479
We will spend the night at
the headquarters in Saklivadi.

595
01:10:20,160 --> 01:10:25,039
When will my father come back,
mother? We still haven't heard from him.

596
01:10:25,120 --> 01:10:29,839
How can we ask a man who went to
fulfill his duty when he will come back?

597
01:10:30,120 --> 01:10:32,959
Sisters!

598
01:10:34,000 --> 01:10:36,119
Give that to me.

599
01:10:39,440 --> 01:10:44,239
So... Draw your sword. Show me your talent.

600
01:10:44,320 --> 01:10:47,799
Alright... So you want to test me, huh?

601
01:10:48,720 --> 01:10:53,839
Let's see if your wrist
got stronger, Fatma sister.

602
01:10:55,000 --> 01:10:57,279
Come on.

603
01:11:06,480 --> 01:11:11,599
-Praise be to my daughter.
-I am your student.

604
01:11:11,680 --> 01:11:15,559
We will see.

605
01:11:43,600 --> 01:11:47,999
Osman... -Mother..

606
01:11:49,680 --> 01:11:55,759
Mother... Mother... Are you
alright? Mother, forgive me!

607
01:12:12,240 --> 01:12:16,119
My Allah... Protect my Osman and my Orhan...

608
01:12:16,920 --> 01:12:20,959
Let us be victorious in this war.

609
01:12:23,400 --> 01:12:28,039
Mother... mother... mother, are you alright?

610
01:12:28,600 --> 01:12:29,959
My daughter...

611
01:12:30,040 --> 01:12:33,839
Mother, forgive me.
-My daughter, I am alright. Don't be afraid.

612
01:12:34,120 --> 01:12:37,439
I am alright. I am alright.

613
01:12:37,520 --> 01:12:40,519
It's not your fault. I am alright.

614
01:12:41,120 --> 01:12:44,839
For a moment I felt bad.

615
01:12:45,240 --> 01:12:47,439
I am now alright.
-Mother...

616
01:12:47,560 --> 01:12:52,599
Don't be afraid... Don't
be afraid... I am alright.

617
01:12:52,760 --> 01:12:57,479
Mother... I was so afraid.
-I am alright.

618
01:13:07,760 --> 01:13:12,719
-There's still no trace of my father!
-We will find him, Orhan Bey.

619
01:13:12,880 --> 01:13:16,039
We will find him.

620
01:13:16,680 --> 01:13:21,439
Osman Bey was here. The
dead bodies of the dogs are here.

621
01:13:33,760 --> 01:13:38,639
Contantine dog... He is luring
my father into a trap again.

622
01:13:39,040 --> 01:13:42,559
They must be around!

623
01:13:46,760 --> 01:13:50,199
Alps! Everyone will be on alert!

624
01:13:50,320 --> 01:13:56,759
We will find my father.
We will find him. Come on!

625
01:14:35,880 --> 01:14:40,239
The Sultan of words..

626
01:14:43,120 --> 01:14:44,528
Iltutan...

627
01:14:44,540 --> 01:14:48,799
Once again, a great battle
has fallen to your share.

628
01:14:49,080 --> 01:14:51,679
What are you doing here?

629
01:14:53,240 --> 01:14:56,759
The ground and the sky belong to Allah.

630
01:14:57,000 --> 01:15:00,679
There's nothing else but Him.

631
01:15:01,080 --> 01:15:04,119
We are living our lives
with what He gives to us.

632
01:15:05,040 --> 01:15:07,479
I'm making soup...

633
01:15:07,640 --> 01:15:12,719
...for you. What are you doing here?

634
01:15:19,600 --> 01:15:25,439
There... I fell into the trap of the infidels.

635
01:15:27,240 --> 01:15:33,199
As you can see... I am now here.

636
01:15:36,920 --> 01:15:40,039
You did not fall into a trap.

637
01:15:40,480 --> 01:15:45,639
The trap appeared in the middle of the
way when you were approaching your target.

638
01:15:46,240 --> 01:15:49,437
How can you reach your
target before getting over it?

639
01:15:49,449 --> 01:15:50,519
Then...

640
01:15:51,440 --> 01:15:55,519
...do I still have a long way to go?

641
01:15:57,240 --> 01:16:01,359
You still have a long way to go.

642
01:16:01,440 --> 01:16:07,719
There is You within you.
First, the curtain will be raised.

643
01:16:07,960 --> 01:16:13,559
Then like Hadhrat Abraham, your path is clear.

644
01:16:13,640 --> 01:16:18,239
You have your sword in
your hand to remove the idols.

645
01:16:18,400 --> 01:16:22,079
The One Who...

646
01:16:22,440 --> 01:16:25,439
...created me will surely show me the way.

647
01:16:39,040 --> 01:16:42,999
May your horse be your companion
may Mount Kesis be your guide...

648
01:16:43,080 --> 01:16:45,959
...may Allah help you.

649
01:17:09,040 --> 01:17:12,479
Yunus Emre..

650
01:17:20,600 --> 01:17:24,559
Yunus Emre!

651
01:17:47,000 --> 01:17:51,439
Yunus Emre.. Yunus Emre! Yunus Emre!

652
01:17:51,560 --> 01:17:55,119
Where are you, Dervish?
If you hadn't found me...

653
01:17:55,360 --> 01:17:58,217
...I wouldn't have been
able to find my way.

654
01:17:58,229 --> 01:18:01,039
Now if I cannot walk on
this path, I will be disgraced.

655
01:18:01,720 --> 01:18:07,239
Iltutan...

656
01:18:45,480 --> 01:18:51,479
You are showing me the way again.
You are showing me the way again.

657
01:19:04,680 --> 01:19:08,959
It's as if the ground swallowed
them! Where are they?

658
01:19:09,120 --> 01:19:13,759
Cerkutay Bey! It's your
turn now! Find their tracks!

659
01:19:14,720 --> 01:19:18,319
Alps! Keep looking around! Come on!

660
01:19:18,640 --> 01:19:22,439
Are you still thinking about what
Alexius dog said, my Shahzade?

661
01:19:22,680 --> 01:19:25,439
Right... Holofira is in danger.

662
01:19:25,720 --> 01:19:30,119
No, my Shahzade. Elcim Hatun would not do that.

663
01:19:30,240 --> 01:19:33,959
What do you think, my Shahzade?
-I also don't want to believe it, Konur Bey.

664
01:19:34,200 --> 01:19:37,639
Those dogs might be playing
a game, but Elcim Hatun...

665
01:19:37,720 --> 01:19:41,839
I know Elcim Hatun's attitude towards Holofira.

666
01:19:42,080 --> 01:19:47,079
May Allah forbid, what if that
dog does something to Holofira?

667
01:19:50,120 --> 01:19:54,839
We will find Osman Bey first! We will find him.

668
01:19:55,720 --> 01:19:59,399
There are too many tracks!

669
01:19:59,600 --> 01:20:03,239
What are we going to do now?
-This is dog Constantine.

670
01:20:03,320 --> 01:20:07,399
He did this to stop us from following him.

671
01:20:10,000 --> 01:20:14,039
Karesi Bey. Let's scatter and search
for Osman Bey. Let's not waste any time.

672
01:20:14,160 --> 01:20:17,759
Sure. Let's just find our Osman Bey...

673
01:20:17,840 --> 01:20:21,119
...safe and sound.
-Yes, Karesi Bey.

674
01:20:21,200 --> 01:20:23,919
You go south I'll go west.

675
01:20:24,200 --> 01:20:30,279
May Allah help us. Come on!
-Come on Alps!

676
01:21:05,240 --> 01:21:09,959
I bear witness that there is none
worthy of worship except Allah...

677
01:21:10,360 --> 01:21:19,359
...and I bear witness that Muhammad(PBUH)
is His servant and Messenger.

678
01:21:26,440 --> 01:21:30,639
They want to ruin us.
They want to ruin us.

679
01:21:31,080 --> 01:21:35,839
Thanks to Allah, we can't go
back from this path anymore.

680
01:21:36,520 --> 01:21:40,599
No going back. There is no god but Allah.

681
01:21:41,280 --> 01:21:43,199
There is no god but Allah.

682
01:22:11,000 --> 01:22:14,559
Osman's horse! This way, come on!

683
01:22:48,120 --> 01:22:52,799
Footprints all around! There was a fight here!

684
01:23:00,320 --> 01:23:03,439
Also blood trails on the ground.

685
01:23:17,520 --> 01:23:20,399
This is dog Constantin's doing!

686
01:23:20,520 --> 01:23:25,319
Obviously, they drew my Bey into an ambush.

687
01:23:30,480 --> 01:23:35,879
An arrow of heathens! It
seems my Bey broke it off.

688
01:23:36,640 --> 01:23:40,199
Where are you my Bey?

689
01:23:45,120 --> 01:23:50,519
My Bey's dagger. He was here!

690
01:24:00,480 --> 01:24:03,679
No. No way.

691
01:24:03,960 --> 01:24:06,839
Not at all, brother,

692
01:24:12,200 --> 01:24:14,719
No daggers can fall off the sheath Aykut made.

693
01:24:14,720 --> 01:24:18,037
Osman Bey would never
leave his dagger behind. Is he...

694
01:24:18,049 --> 01:24:19,159
Tugay!

695
01:24:21,160 --> 01:24:25,999
Don't... Say no more.

696
01:24:30,480 --> 01:24:37,159
We'll find our B£y. We'll leave
no stones unturned and find him!

697
01:25:05,920 --> 01:25:10,839
Sir, you're bleeding. We should stop it.

698
01:25:17,640 --> 01:25:22,039
I want reinforcement forces in
Bursa right here immediately, Aleksios.

699
01:25:22,200 --> 01:25:25,759
I've sent a message. They'll be here soon, sir.

700
01:25:26,000 --> 01:25:29,479
Place the soldiers around the headquarters.

701
01:25:29,680 --> 01:25:33,479
Send four men to the river
and tell them to hide well.

702
01:25:33,720 --> 01:25:38,839
Let's see if they can find the alps and Osman.

703
01:26:03,040 --> 01:26:04,959
Soon..

704
01:26:16,960 --> 01:26:20,319
I will...

705
01:26:20,880 --> 01:26:23,759
...get rid of Osman for good.

706
01:27:07,640 --> 01:27:10,799
Mother, are you alright?

707
01:27:11,440 --> 01:27:14,719
I'm fine. I just don't feel comfortable.

708
01:27:15,040 --> 01:27:18,239
-I'll go take fresh air.
-Mother, are you alright?

709
01:27:18,240 --> 01:27:22,199
Brother, this is the second time. It
also happened during the training.

710
01:27:22,320 --> 01:27:25,639
Are you sick, mother? Brother?

711
01:27:26,000 --> 01:27:27,999
Did you exhaust yourself, mother?

712
01:27:28,200 --> 01:27:32,039
-I can examine you.
-No, son. I'm not exhausted.

713
01:27:32,520 --> 01:27:34,959
I just have a bad feeling.

714
01:27:35,040 --> 01:27:38,079
I feel it at times. But it's alright.

715
01:27:38,560 --> 01:27:41,159
I'll go refresh my ablution.

716
01:27:41,400 --> 01:27:45,319
-Come on.
-Do I have permission, Bala Hatun?

717
01:27:45,680 --> 01:27:48,679
Come in!

718
01:27:51,440 --> 01:27:54,759
Baysungur. Good or bad news?

719
01:27:56,000 --> 01:27:59,119
I've brought a message from Shahzade Orhan.

720
01:28:00,480 --> 01:28:03,039
The dog called Constantin...

721
01:28:04,600 --> 01:28:06,519
..drew us into an ambush.

722
01:28:06,720 --> 01:28:08,639
Orhan?

723
01:28:10,360 --> 01:28:12,999
What are you saying Baysungur?

724
01:28:13,240 --> 01:28:18,519
Are Osman Bey and Orhan alright?
Orhan sent the message. And Osman?

725
01:28:19,960 --> 01:28:23,879
We don't know where Osman Bey is.

726
01:28:24,320 --> 01:28:27,519
What do you mean? What
are you saying, Baysungur?

727
01:28:27,520 --> 01:28:30,359
Weren't you with him?

728
01:28:30,600 --> 01:28:33,679
And my brother? Where is he?

729
01:28:34,240 --> 01:28:36,679
Shahzade Orhan...

730
01:28:37,200 --> 01:28:41,479
...is looking for Osman Bey with the alps.

731
01:28:41,760 --> 01:28:44,199
-We got separated from Osman Bey.
-My Allah...

732
01:28:44,400 --> 01:28:46,319
Protect my father, my Allah.

733
01:28:46,440 --> 01:28:49,759
Tell me, Baysungur. How could
Osman Bey fall into the ambush?

734
01:28:49,920 --> 01:28:53,479
They found out that Holofira was a spy.

735
01:28:55,000 --> 01:28:58,359
They drew Osman Bey into the ambush.

736
01:29:00,120 --> 01:29:05,159
If Holofira is exposed, it
means there is a traitor.

737
01:29:05,360 --> 01:29:07,119
Baysungur.

738
01:29:07,320 --> 01:29:12,399
-There is more.
-A hatun in the tribe...

739
01:29:15,360 --> 01:29:17,759
..sent a letter to Aleksios.

740
01:29:17,800 --> 01:29:22,039
-Who said that? -Shahzade Orhan heard himself.

741
01:29:22,360 --> 01:29:24,239
He heard what?

742
01:29:26,840 --> 01:29:29,319
Aleksios got the letter...

743
01:29:29,560 --> 01:29:32,879
What letter? Tell me who
sent the letter, Baysungur.

744
01:29:33,160 --> 01:29:36,199
Aleksios...

745
01:29:38,560 --> 01:29:41,759
He implied Elcim Hatun.

746
01:29:42,080 --> 01:29:43,839
What?

747
01:29:46,720 --> 01:29:50,919
Are you hearing yourself,
Baysungur? What are you talking about?

748
01:29:53,000 --> 01:29:56,799
-Elcim.
-Bala Hatun.

749
01:29:57,160 --> 01:30:02,359
My Shahzade Orhan told me to tell you..

750
01:30:02,560 --> 01:30:05,759
..that you would know what to do.

751
01:31:06,160 --> 01:31:12,199
So you finally woke up. Thank God.

752
01:31:16,000 --> 01:31:22,039
-Thank you.
-Enjoy.

753
01:31:32,280 --> 01:31:35,199
Are you alright?

754
01:31:37,680 --> 01:31:41,359
Thanks to you, I am alright.

755
01:31:42,000 --> 01:31:46,319
What about you?

756
01:31:47,240 --> 01:31:49,399
Why are you helping a Turk?

757
01:31:49,480 --> 01:31:51,439
We saved a wounded man.

758
01:31:51,600 --> 01:31:55,479
We didn't ask who you were.

759
01:32:11,520 --> 01:32:17,119
However, do you allow us to ask about your name?

760
01:32:18,760 --> 01:32:21,799
My name

761
01:32:25,760 --> 01:32:30,199
-..is Mustafa.
-So you are carrying the name of our Prophet.

762
01:32:32,720 --> 01:32:38,279
-So you know Him. -More than that..

763
01:32:38,640 --> 01:32:43,199
..Yunus Emre told us many times.

764
01:32:51,240 --> 01:32:54,119
Mushroom soup, drink it.

765
01:32:54,240 --> 01:32:56,999
The only friend of us monks out in the forest.

766
01:32:57,080 --> 01:32:59,759
It will make you stronger.

767
01:33:04,720 --> 01:33:08,719
We've collected mushrooms and made soup..

768
01:33:08,800 --> 01:33:12,159
..so that you can drink it.

769
01:33:12,640 --> 01:33:16,479
May your horse be your friend
Monk Mountain your map..

770
01:33:16,640 --> 01:33:20,119
..and Allah be your guide.

771
01:33:39,560 --> 01:33:43,079
What about your name, monk?

772
01:33:43,240 --> 01:33:47,999
I am Simon. You were in
rough shape when we found you.

773
01:33:48,440 --> 01:33:52,119
God has protected you.

774
01:33:52,280 --> 01:33:55,079
Aren't you going to ask?

775
01:33:55,280 --> 01:34:00,959
Who put me in this shape?
Who will you face against?

776
01:34:01,040 --> 01:34:03,239
We do not ask what.

777
01:34:03,480 --> 01:34:07,319
The One who put you in our
way must've thought about it.

778
01:34:08,280 --> 01:34:13,159
Now, you are wondering what are we doing here.

779
01:34:13,240 --> 01:34:17,399
Yes. What are you doing in here?

780
01:34:17,720 --> 01:34:22,199
Empire's religion does not accept us.

781
01:34:22,720 --> 01:34:28,359
However, our hearts do not
accept their religion as well.

782
01:34:28,960 --> 01:34:32,479
Alright, good. Do not worry..

783
01:34:32,600 --> 01:34:37,439
..you surely have a home as well.

784
01:34:44,560 --> 01:34:48,519
Alaeddin, send Baysungur
and Orhan alps for support.

785
01:34:48,680 --> 01:34:52,279
-No, let me go as well, mother.
-You will stay here, son.

786
01:34:52,720 --> 01:34:56,839
The tribe is entrusted to you. Come on.

787
01:34:57,520 --> 01:34:59,919
Come on Baysungur.

788
01:35:08,120 --> 01:35:12,879
Do you not believe me? Bala Hatun?

789
01:35:14,520 --> 01:35:17,599
Gonca.

790
01:35:18,280 --> 01:35:20,759
-Fatma, you too?
-I..

791
01:35:21,080 --> 01:35:25,679
..do not know who is guilty. I
am thinking about my father.

792
01:35:27,320 --> 01:35:30,599
I got married for the good of this tribe.

793
01:35:30,680 --> 01:35:34,639
Would I disrupt this union
with my own hands now?

794
01:35:34,720 --> 01:35:38,039
You didn't want Orhan to
go to Bursa, right, Elcim?

795
01:35:38,120 --> 01:35:40,279
Yes. I did not want to.

796
01:35:40,560 --> 01:35:43,319
I did not want him to see Holofira.

797
01:35:43,400 --> 01:35:47,759
Elcim, if you did this with a sudden anger..

798
01:35:48,520 --> 01:35:51,279
..we understand you. Tell us the truth.

799
01:35:51,360 --> 01:35:56,039
I do not mix my personal emotions
with State affairs, I did not do it!

800
01:35:56,320 --> 01:36:01,719
No one else knew Holofira was a spy.

801
01:36:01,920 --> 01:36:05,719
Don't do this, Bala Hatun.

802
01:36:05,800 --> 01:36:09,039
Ulgen, Kismet.

803
01:36:09,280 --> 01:36:11,559
Elcim will not leave her tent..

804
01:36:11,640 --> 01:36:13,999
..until Osman Bey and Orhan comes.

805
01:36:14,080 --> 01:36:19,879
She will see no one. Put alps on her door.

806
01:36:28,840 --> 01:36:31,839
Elcim is not someone who
can make such a huge mistake.

807
01:36:31,960 --> 01:36:35,359
Of course not. However she is a human as well.

808
01:36:35,520 --> 01:36:38,719
Longing can make one blind, my daughter.

809
01:36:39,000 --> 01:36:44,599
We will reveal the truth with justice.

810
01:36:45,680 --> 01:36:50,879
We did wrong for years, Kanyumaz.

811
01:36:51,360 --> 01:36:54,359
We thought we would've
defeated Osman with swords.

812
01:36:54,520 --> 01:36:57,799
However, look what a letter did.

813
01:36:57,920 --> 01:37:00,439
They are now against themselves.

814
01:37:00,560 --> 01:37:04,119
Mind is greater than sword, my Shahzade.

815
01:37:04,440 --> 01:37:08,359
So Osman hid Husrev at Bursa as a spy.

816
01:37:08,440 --> 01:37:11,799
What good can that do, my
Shahzade. He is dead now.

817
01:37:11,880 --> 01:37:15,719
I took his life myself.

818
01:37:15,960 --> 01:37:20,799
Alright. We will break Kayis like this.

819
01:37:21,000 --> 01:37:25,479
Look, now they have chaors in the tribe.

820
01:37:30,680 --> 01:37:34,679
-What tribe are you talking about, Mehmed?
-Father.

821
01:37:37,440 --> 01:37:40,439
What is happening in the tribe?

822
01:37:41,760 --> 01:37:44,239
Osman.

823
01:37:44,320 --> 01:37:46,919
..went to attack Konstantin, however..

824
01:37:47,000 --> 01:37:49,479
..he fell to a trap.

825
01:37:49,720 --> 01:37:53,479
They say Elcim Hatun told Konstantin..

826
01:37:53,840 --> 01:37:56,359
..about Osman's attack.

827
01:38:01,560 --> 01:38:04,079
Elcim Hatun you say.

828
01:38:04,600 --> 01:38:07,679
Nevermind, father.
You get some rest.

829
01:38:07,800 --> 01:38:10,519
Let them eat each other.

830
01:38:13,000 --> 01:38:14,999
According to our belief..

831
01:38:15,160 --> 01:38:18,839
..every human God has created
is equal to one and another.

832
01:38:18,920 --> 01:38:23,799
Rich and poor are the
same in the face of justice.

833
01:38:24,800 --> 01:38:28,999
Just like in divine religions.

834
01:38:30,000 --> 01:38:33,439
Of course, whoever has the power..

835
01:38:34,160 --> 01:38:37,679
..does not allow it.
-Unfortunately.

836
01:38:38,040 --> 01:38:40,639
Those who hold that power..

837
01:38:40,800 --> 01:38:43,439
..are the ones who banished us.

838
01:38:43,520 --> 01:38:48,279
We couldn't settle in neither Iznik nor Bursa.

839
01:38:48,440 --> 01:38:52,039
Monk Mountain became our home.

840
01:38:52,240 --> 01:38:53,959
Iznik was..

841
01:38:54,160 --> 01:38:58,039
..the land of Turks at Suleyman Shah's era.

842
01:38:58,480 --> 01:39:03,719
Did issues like this happened back then?

843
01:39:03,800 --> 01:39:06,999
Nikea is one of the holiest..

844
01:39:07,080 --> 01:39:09,519
..cities of the
World of Christianity.

845
01:39:09,800 --> 01:39:13,319
Maybe the most holiest, after Quds.

846
01:39:14,320 --> 01:39:17,359
While it was at the hands of Seljuks..

847
01:39:17,480 --> 01:39:21,999
..the monks who escaped from
Byzantine used to take shelter in Iznik.

848
01:39:22,400 --> 01:39:26,679
Still, Turks showed hospitality to us.

849
01:39:26,800 --> 01:39:29,599
Until crusaders came.

850
01:39:29,960 --> 01:39:34,439
You went against he Church
of the Emperor as well.

851
01:39:34,560 --> 01:39:38,999
Didn't that make your situation harder?

852
01:39:39,680 --> 01:39:43,119
We only walk on the path we know, Mustafa.

853
01:39:43,280 --> 01:39:47,079
They bring the God to the human level.

854
01:39:47,240 --> 01:39:51,439
They make Him an idol, material.
They put the cross on their armor..

855
01:39:51,520 --> 01:39:54,159
..and commit murders..

856
01:39:54,240 --> 01:39:56,959
..with fancy idols.

857
01:39:57,160 --> 01:40:00,919
We believe that God is only one.

858
01:40:01,120 --> 01:40:05,279
And he is always with us.

859
01:40:06,840 --> 01:40:11,199
You are against this like us, muslims.

860
01:40:11,760 --> 01:40:15,319
Do not worry. From now on..

861
01:40:15,600 --> 01:40:19,559
..tyranny of oppressors won't continue.

862
01:40:21,240 --> 01:40:24,599
Bursa and Iznik..

863
01:40:24,960 --> 01:40:30,559
..will be the land of Turks sooner or later.

864
01:40:33,480 --> 01:40:38,359
And you will live there forever.

865
01:40:51,400 --> 01:40:54,359
In the name of Allah.

866
01:41:01,040 --> 01:41:04,879
My Gonca, what are you doing here?

867
01:41:05,120 --> 01:41:08,399
Didn't I tell you to rest?

868
01:41:10,040 --> 01:41:15,239
Well, Alaaddin... I couldn't stay in
the tent thinking about my father.

869
01:41:16,880 --> 01:41:19,919
Any news from Osman Bey?

870
01:41:20,160 --> 01:41:24,559
-Gonca Hatun! Gonca Hatun!
-Hey! What are you doing?

871
01:41:24,840 --> 01:41:28,159
-Mother, stop chasing me!
-Stop, Ghazi!

872
01:41:31,400 --> 01:41:33,399
What are you doing, Ghazi?

873
01:41:33,600 --> 01:41:36,199
-What is this?
-Your baby's gift, Gonca Hatun.

874
01:41:36,280 --> 01:41:39,559
Is this your crib? Why are
you giving her this old thing?

875
01:41:39,720 --> 01:41:42,399
-Mother, don't touch! Don't touch!
-Ghazi!

876
01:41:42,480 --> 01:41:44,039
I'm a grown up man!

877
01:41:44,120 --> 01:41:47,479
You won't have another baby, anyway.

878
01:41:47,600 --> 01:41:50,999
-And this isn't my crib.
-Do whatever you want.

879
01:41:51,080 --> 01:41:56,439
Another baby? I can hardly control
you. Another one? No, thanks.

880
01:41:56,520 --> 01:41:58,479
Ghazi.

881
01:41:59,480 --> 01:42:03,439
You didn't do what I think, did you?

882
01:42:03,560 --> 01:42:06,399
Look at me.

883
01:42:06,720 --> 01:42:08,719
What are you talking about?

884
01:42:12,320 --> 01:42:15,359
This is for your baby, Gonca Hatun.

885
01:42:19,400 --> 01:42:22,679
Where did you find this, Ghazi? Ha, boy?

886
01:42:22,800 --> 01:42:24,719
Someone made it and put it outside.

887
01:42:24,800 --> 01:42:27,599
And I just took it. Huh, Gonca Hatun?

888
01:42:27,720 --> 01:42:30,359
-How do you like it?
-Very nice.

889
01:42:30,520 --> 01:42:34,439
You did well boy...

890
01:42:38,120 --> 01:42:40,799
You made it?

891
01:42:40,880 --> 01:42:43,599
I was going to bring it
when it was finished, but...

892
01:42:43,680 --> 01:42:46,879
...Ghazi did Ghazi things again.

893
01:42:52,880 --> 01:42:55,919
It's beautiful.

894
01:42:58,840 --> 01:43:03,039
I gave you the gift but you're hugging Shahzade.

895
01:43:03,240 --> 01:43:06,719
-Come here, I'll show you how to hug!
-Alaaddin!

896
01:43:06,960 --> 01:43:10,999
-This is a test from Allah, right?
-Don't you say, Ulgen!

897
01:43:11,560 --> 01:43:14,799
I'm sorry.

898
01:43:15,680 --> 01:43:18,279
He makes us smile even in these hard times.

899
01:43:18,480 --> 01:43:20,719
-My Hatun.
-Yes.

900
01:43:21,240 --> 01:43:24,319
Yakup Bey and Mehmed Bey are leaving.

901
01:43:27,840 --> 01:43:33,479
Let's go see your father off, my dear.

902
01:43:38,440 --> 01:43:41,879
Alps, take this to the tent.

903
01:43:59,520 --> 01:44:02,599
My Allah.

904
01:44:03,600 --> 01:44:06,759
You know me better than I myself do.

905
01:44:07,920 --> 01:44:10,639
They're attempting to play tricks...

906
01:44:11,000 --> 01:44:14,959
...and drive a wedge between me and my family.

907
01:44:16,640 --> 01:44:19,559
Don't let them, my Allah.

908
01:44:20,800 --> 01:44:23,359
Lead their tricks..

909
01:44:24,080 --> 01:44:28,079
...to their deaths. Aameen.

910
01:45:20,320 --> 01:45:23,319
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

911
01:45:29,000 --> 01:45:31,879
Bala Hatun, we want to see Elcim Hatun.

912
01:45:32,040 --> 01:45:35,719
Elcim Hatun is innocent!
We want to see Elcim Hatun.

913
01:45:41,800 --> 01:45:46,799
Bala Hatun, we want to see Elcim Hatun.

914
01:45:49,800 --> 01:45:51,239
What are you doing, Beys?

915
01:45:51,320 --> 01:45:53,839
Gunduz Bey trusted us to look after her.

916
01:45:54,240 --> 01:45:58,279
Since when have you been entering
Osman Bey's tent without permission?

917
01:45:58,760 --> 01:46:00,479
We want to see Elcim Hatun.

918
01:46:00,560 --> 01:46:02,839
We won't let her be slandered.

919
01:46:02,840 --> 01:46:05,039
Who are you protecting her from?

920
01:46:05,360 --> 01:46:09,679
From those who betray our trust!

921
01:46:11,520 --> 01:46:15,799
Haydar Bey, my patience has limits.

922
01:46:16,000 --> 01:46:19,839
If you go further, I won't
mind Gunduz Bey's memory.

923
01:46:20,040 --> 01:46:22,879
You already dishonored his memory, Bala Hatun.

924
01:46:22,960 --> 01:46:26,879
Enough! Put your swords down!

925
01:46:28,440 --> 01:46:30,839
All of you!

926
01:46:32,080 --> 01:46:37,399
Haydar Bey, this is not a matter
which can be discussed in public.

927
01:46:39,040 --> 01:46:44,039
Hasan, take Beys to Osman Bey's tent.

928
01:46:44,400 --> 01:46:49,439
-And host their alps in the tribe.
-As you order, Bala Hatun.

929
01:46:51,120 --> 01:46:54,239
Haydar Bey, give me your swords.

930
01:47:21,720 --> 01:47:23,999
Yakup Bey.

931
01:47:31,640 --> 01:47:34,519
You should take these regularly.

932
01:47:34,760 --> 01:47:39,079
For your health, you
have to. Don't be obstinate.

933
01:47:48,120 --> 01:47:51,399
I owe you one, Alaaddin Bey.

934
01:47:51,880 --> 01:47:54,719
You owe me nothing, Yakup Bey.

935
01:47:55,560 --> 01:47:59,879
I did everything for my wife's sake.

936
01:48:02,200 --> 01:48:04,839
Stay safe.

937
01:48:07,760 --> 01:48:10,719
Sorry for the trouble.

938
01:48:11,720 --> 01:48:13,919
Not at all.

939
01:48:18,320 --> 01:48:21,279
Take a good care of your father, Mehmed.

940
01:48:21,440 --> 01:48:24,359
He should take medicine on time.

941
01:48:25,160 --> 01:48:29,719
I can take care of my father,
Alaaddin. Don't be worrying.

942
01:48:30,640 --> 01:48:33,479
In fact, you should take care of your father.

943
01:48:34,920 --> 01:48:38,439
Well... They say there's a traitor among you.

944
01:48:38,720 --> 01:48:42,359
Ha, Alaaddin? There are many traitors among you.

945
01:48:42,720 --> 01:48:46,119
You can't clear off those traitors.

946
01:48:46,720 --> 01:48:50,599
That's why you never get rid of troubles.

947
01:48:53,000 --> 01:48:55,039
Come on, Mehmed!

948
01:49:08,400 --> 01:49:13,199
When my father sman Bey is back,
we will have the wedding, Yakup Bey.

949
01:49:13,480 --> 01:49:16,839
We'd like to see you here with us.

950
01:49:26,040 --> 01:49:29,839
I have no place in that wedding.

951
01:49:32,120 --> 01:49:35,399
Enjoy your wedding.

952
01:49:49,640 --> 01:49:53,639
Oh, Yakup Bey...

953
01:49:59,000 --> 01:50:01,199
Come on, my dear.

954
01:50:02,280 --> 01:50:05,439
Come on.

955
01:51:00,120 --> 01:51:03,799
-Someone's coming.
-Hurry up! Hurry up!

956
01:51:17,920 --> 01:51:20,839
Traitors.

957
01:51:23,440 --> 01:51:27,039
Traitors..

958
01:51:31,640 --> 01:51:35,679
-Leave the monks alone.
-This land belongs to the empire.

959
01:51:35,880 --> 01:51:40,359
-It will be as we want.
-They harm nobody.

960
01:51:40,840 --> 01:51:45,079
Show them mercy so you
will be treated in the same way.

961
01:51:45,120 --> 01:51:50,479
Mercy should only be given to
those who deserve. These are traitors.

962
01:51:53,720 --> 01:51:56,919
-Are you looking for someone?
-Osman.

963
01:51:57,160 --> 01:52:00,679
That's why I told you to leave them alone.

964
01:52:02,160 --> 01:52:04,639
The one who you're looking for is here.

965
01:52:05,120 --> 01:52:06,279
-He's Osman.
-Yes, Osman.

966
01:52:06,280 --> 01:52:08,599
-He's Osman.
-Yes, Osman.

967
01:52:08,840 --> 01:52:12,359
This wounded wolf can even beat five of you.

968
01:52:12,359 --> 01:52:13,888
Attack!

969
01:52:28,280 --> 01:52:32,479
Now tell me where Constantin is.

970
01:52:33,280 --> 01:52:36,799
Where is Constantin?

971
01:53:17,280 --> 01:53:21,679
Come on! Search! Search!

972
01:53:35,320 --> 01:53:40,759
Aleksios, you'll bring
Osman dead or alive to me!

973
01:53:40,960 --> 01:53:43,559
Come on!

974
01:53:53,280 --> 01:53:58,039
Nobody is going anywhere until you find Osman!

975
01:54:12,240 --> 01:54:13,563
Find Osman for me!

976
01:54:13,575 --> 01:54:17,439
Sir, you have a wound.
You shouldn't have come here.

977
01:54:26,640 --> 01:54:31,119
Commander Constantin,
there are some trails here.

978
01:54:35,320 --> 01:54:41,719
The soil is worn. Someone
crawled out of the stream.

979
01:54:57,240 --> 01:55:01,239
He was bleeding.

980
01:55:04,640 --> 01:55:08,399
He stitched his wound with horsehair.

981
01:55:11,840 --> 01:55:16,319
That Osman did not die!

982
01:55:22,560 --> 01:55:27,999
There are other footprints as
well. Someone took him away!

983
01:55:31,640 --> 01:55:35,799
The footprints are going this way!

984
01:55:36,320 --> 01:55:41,599
We will find Osman and
finish what we left half-finished.

985
01:55:43,200 --> 01:55:46,159
Come on!

986
01:55:51,440 --> 01:55:55,147
Tell me where he is, so
you will die right away.

987
01:55:55,159 --> 01:55:56,399
In Saklivadi...

988
01:55:56,560 --> 01:55:59,639
..at Kizilcinar.

989
01:56:09,320 --> 01:56:14,679
Even if you don't know my
name, infidels will not forget it.

990
01:56:14,920 --> 01:56:18,439
You hosted Osman Bey in your house. Thank you.

991
01:56:18,520 --> 01:56:22,559
Nothing changed for us, Osman Bey.

992
01:56:23,120 --> 01:56:27,839
You are bleeding.
-Thank you. Thank you.

993
01:56:28,320 --> 01:56:31,639
We cannot stay here now. We have to go.

994
01:56:31,800 --> 01:56:37,359
Right... From now on, you won't stay here.

995
01:56:42,680 --> 01:56:45,839
Take this.

996
01:56:46,320 --> 01:56:49,039
If you give this to someone...

997
01:56:49,200 --> 01:56:52,319
...in my land, in my homeland...

998
01:56:52,400 --> 01:56:55,119
..all doors will open for you.

999
01:56:58,760 --> 01:57:03,199
You're giving us the key that will
open the doors of your land. Thank you.

1000
01:57:03,720 --> 01:57:05,839
Thank you.

1001
01:57:06,120 --> 01:57:08,639
And the key that will..

1002
01:57:08,840 --> 01:57:12,839
...open the doors of Bursa and Nikea...

1003
01:57:12,960 --> 01:57:15,839
...is the mercy in your heart.

1004
01:57:18,080 --> 01:57:21,039
Thank you.

1005
01:57:24,600 --> 01:57:27,879
Here, Osman Bey.
We washed and cleaned them.

1006
01:57:28,560 --> 01:57:31,199
Thank you, thank you.

1007
01:57:46,920 --> 01:57:49,519
Come on.

1008
01:57:55,840 --> 01:57:59,999
I heard from Alps. You are keeping
Elcim Hatun in her tent like a prisoner.

1009
01:58:00,040 --> 01:58:01,139
How did this happen?

1010
01:58:01,151 --> 01:58:03,039
We are doing
all these things...

1011
01:58:03,040 --> 01:58:05,759
...to secure justice, Haydar Bey.

1012
01:58:05,880 --> 01:58:09,399
What do you accuse Elcim Hatun of? Tell us.

1013
01:58:09,600 --> 01:58:13,399
It's a private matter that
shouldn't be discussed.

1014
01:58:13,480 --> 01:58:15,999
We will solve it within the family.

1015
01:58:16,160 --> 01:58:18,919
Don't you trust someone from your own family?

1016
01:58:19,040 --> 01:58:21,839
If you do not release Elcim Hatun now...

1017
01:58:21,920 --> 01:58:24,279
...both unity and order will be disrupted.

1018
01:58:24,360 --> 01:58:26,759
We won't remain silent about this.
-Stop there...

1019
01:58:26,840 --> 01:58:29,519
..Haydar Bey! Stop there!

1020
01:58:29,600 --> 01:58:32,559
Don't cross the line. It's not your place...

1021
01:58:32,760 --> 01:58:36,639
...to threaten us. Know your place.

1022
01:58:39,160 --> 01:58:41,999
It's not a threat it's the truth.

1023
01:58:42,000 --> 01:58:44,799
You are keeping Gunduz Bey's trust imprisoned.

1024
01:58:44,800 --> 01:58:46,719
How can we protect the unity now?

1025
01:58:46,840 --> 01:58:49,239
Beys! -We can.

1026
01:58:49,320 --> 01:58:55,359
Haydar Bey. And you will
wait calmly in your tribe.

1027
01:58:55,920 --> 01:58:59,439
The secret of the Kayi has been
revealed. We will find who did this.

1028
01:58:59,800 --> 01:59:02,479
Besides, Elcim is not just...

1029
01:59:02,560 --> 01:59:06,559
...Gunduz Bey's trust, she is
also a daughter of this family.

1030
01:59:06,760 --> 01:59:10,519
I won't sacrifice my daughter
in law to the slander of infidels!

1031
01:59:10,840 --> 01:59:14,919
Alaeddin!

1032
01:59:29,040 --> 01:59:34,239
Beys. We are doing what
is necessary for justice.

1033
01:59:34,400 --> 01:59:38,439
There's no need to worry.

1034
01:59:40,600 --> 01:59:44,079
Instead of wasting your
time with these matters...

1035
01:59:45,200 --> 01:59:48,679
...go and train your Alps.

1036
01:59:48,960 --> 01:59:54,919
There are many fortresses for Kayi to take.

1037
01:59:56,560 --> 01:59:59,799
You heard our daughter Elcim, Haydar Bey.

1038
01:59:59,880 --> 02:00:06,159
Go now, our Alps will accompany
you back to your tribe. Come on.

1039
02:00:18,480 --> 02:00:22,479
There's still no news from my
father or my brother/ mother.

1040
02:00:24,480 --> 02:00:30,079
There is no need to worry, my son.
Osman Bey is alright. I know that.

1041
02:00:30,160 --> 02:00:33,719
Come on. Everyone back to their duties!

1042
02:00:33,960 --> 02:00:36,439
Elcim..

1043
02:00:36,560 --> 02:00:41,759
Go to your tent now. I'll talk to you.

1044
02:00:52,240 --> 02:00:55,919
Where is this place?
-It must be the place of monks.

1045
02:00:56,680 --> 02:01:01,959
So they saved Osman.

1046
02:01:05,600 --> 02:01:09,599
Commander... Soldiers!

1047
02:01:36,080 --> 02:01:38,839
Osman.

1048
02:01:39,240 --> 02:01:43,999
So he was stron enough to kill the soldie

1049
02:01:54,000 --> 02:01:57,759
You will find the track of...

1050
02:01:57,840 --> 02:02:02,599
...Osman and the monks, Alexius.

1051
02:02:14,920 --> 02:02:17,839
I swear to Jesus..

1052
02:02:18,200 --> 02:02:21,639
I will send them to hell with my own hands.

1053
02:02:47,760 --> 02:02:51,919
Who are you? -Stop, Solgur Agha.

1054
02:02:52,280 --> 02:02:56,519
They are monks.

1055
02:03:03,000 --> 02:03:06,879
No one knows this forest better than you.

1056
02:03:08,440 --> 02:03:12,839
We are looking for our Bey. His name is Osman.

1057
02:03:13,080 --> 02:03:16,719
He is a brave Turk Bey. Tell me.

1058
02:03:16,920 --> 02:03:21,039
Have you seen him before?

1059
02:03:24,160 --> 02:03:27,439
Are you looking for the owner of this ring?

1060
02:03:54,440 --> 02:03:56,519
My Bey's ring.

1061
02:03:59,640 --> 02:04:02,719
Tell me now! Tell me!

1062
02:04:02,840 --> 02:04:08,639
How did you get this ring, huh?

1063
02:04:10,440 --> 02:04:11,879
Osman Bey gave it to us.

1064
02:04:11,880 --> 02:04:15,519
He said this ring would open
every door in his homeland.

1065
02:04:15,520 --> 02:04:18,359
Cut it short! Where is Osman Bey?

1066
02:04:18,560 --> 02:04:22,439
He was injured... We treated him.

1067
02:04:27,480 --> 02:04:31,999
Alps... Don't hurt them.

1068
02:04:39,480 --> 02:04:41,130
Where is he now?
Where did he go?

1069
02:04:41,142 --> 02:04:42,559
He went to keep his promise.

1070
02:04:42,680 --> 02:04:45,759
That's what he said to us.
-My Bey...

1071
02:04:46,720 --> 02:04:50,079
My Bey will go after Constantine.

1072
02:04:50,480 --> 02:04:54,879
Osman Bey is going to death alone.

1073
02:04:57,120 --> 02:05:00,159
It's obvious... There will be a fight.

1074
02:05:00,240 --> 02:05:03,519
But they will be the ones who die.

1075
02:05:03,720 --> 02:05:08,399
Alps... My Bey is injured. Come on!

1076
02:05:31,120 --> 02:05:36,959
I see disappointment in your
eyes, but I don't see regret, Elcim.

1077
02:05:37,760 --> 02:05:40,919
I haven't done anything to regret, Bala Hatun.

1078
02:05:41,000 --> 02:05:45,479
You know what happens if Holofira's
espionage is exposed, don't you?

1079
02:05:45,800 --> 02:05:50,599
Especially when Osman
Bey and Orhan were in Bursa...

1080
02:05:50,720 --> 02:05:54,079
...this means their lives were at risk.
-Yes.

1081
02:05:54,520 --> 02:05:57,959
Not only Holofira's life...

1082
02:05:58,160 --> 02:06:02,559
...but also Osman Bey's,
Orhan's, and the Alps' lives.

1083
02:06:03,960 --> 02:06:07,239
Only a stupid woman...

1084
02:06:07,360 --> 02:06:09,719
...who has become the servant of her weakness...

1085
02:06:09,800 --> 02:06:14,399
...blinded by jealousy
could reveal this secret...

1086
02:06:16,400 --> 02:06:18,719
-Or..
-Or?

1087
02:06:19,560 --> 02:06:24,279
I do not do such stupidity.

1088
02:06:24,840 --> 02:06:27,959
Or someone who is an enemy of Kayi.

1089
02:06:28,200 --> 02:06:30,479
This is treachery.

1090
02:06:30,560 --> 02:06:34,559
I do not betray my house, Bala Hatun.

1091
02:06:38,280 --> 02:06:40,719
I know.

1092
02:06:41,160 --> 02:06:46,399
You sacrificed many
things for this tribe, Elcim.

1093
02:06:46,600 --> 02:06:50,279
Then why are you keeping me in my tent?

1094
02:06:50,360 --> 02:06:54,679
Don't you trust my word?

1095
02:06:56,400 --> 02:07:01,079
The position I am in taught
me to never trust anyone.

1096
02:07:01,200 --> 02:07:03,119
We are humans.

1097
02:07:03,280 --> 02:07:05,999
We have weaknesses.

1098
02:07:06,080 --> 02:07:08,279
Everyone can make mistakes.

1099
02:07:08,360 --> 02:07:13,399
This slander brought upon me is no mistake.

1100
02:07:14,480 --> 02:07:17,199
This is not about Holofira as well.

1101
02:07:17,440 --> 02:07:21,279
Yes, I was jealous.

1102
02:07:21,720 --> 02:07:25,159
-Like every woman would do.
-However..

1103
02:07:25,240 --> 02:07:28,519
..this is a State issue.

1104
02:07:29,240 --> 02:07:34,119
And I have married for this State.

1105
02:07:34,360 --> 02:07:37,799
I do not put the future of The State in danger..

1106
02:07:37,880 --> 02:07:41,599
..for my own ambition.

1107
02:07:45,880 --> 02:07:50,959
I am not mad at you.

1108
02:07:51,320 --> 02:07:53,679
No matter what you do..

1109
02:07:53,880 --> 02:07:59,719
..you think about your Bey,
your children and your tribe.

1110
02:08:00,880 --> 02:08:04,279
However, I wonder one thing.

1111
02:08:05,400 --> 02:08:08,359
Do you believe me, Bala Hatun?

1112
02:08:20,760 --> 02:08:25,679
Were you looking for me? You snake! Traitor!

1113
02:08:28,200 --> 02:08:33,879
Do you serve Konstantin now after my aunt?

1114
02:08:34,320 --> 02:08:40,439
I do not forget anything.

1115
02:08:40,560 --> 02:08:44,999
Did you hear me? Never!

1116
02:08:45,320 --> 02:08:51,279
You will pay for everything.

1117
02:08:52,280 --> 02:08:56,039
However, first, you will tell me everything.

1118
02:08:56,400 --> 02:09:00,239
Did you hear me? Everything!

1119
02:09:00,400 --> 02:09:03,279
-I heard you.
-Everything!

1120
02:09:52,520 --> 02:09:56,839
Since Osman gathered his
strength and killed our soldiers..

1121
02:09:57,160 --> 02:10:00,439
..he must have gone to his tribe.
-No.

1122
02:10:00,600 --> 02:10:03,879
-He did not.
-However..

1123
02:10:05,600 --> 02:10:08,879
He will not leave before
finishing what he has started.

1124
02:10:10,000 --> 02:10:12,799
So am I.

1125
02:10:14,240 --> 02:10:17,439
I will find every tribe of his..

1126
02:10:17,560 --> 02:10:21,399
..and destroy each and every one of them.

1127
02:10:29,080 --> 02:10:31,999
He will come after me.

1128
02:10:32,840 --> 02:10:34,879
I am not a man who will cover behind..

1129
02:10:35,000 --> 02:10:40,479
..the walls of Constantinople.

1130
02:10:40,800 --> 02:10:46,279
Do not forget, Holofira does
not still know about the truth.

1131
02:10:50,520 --> 02:10:52,479
You Elcim Hatun sent a letter..

1132
02:10:52,640 --> 02:10:55,639
..to Konstantin. Is that so?

1133
02:10:57,200 --> 02:11:00,559
She told everything. You being Osman Bey's spy..

1134
02:11:00,720 --> 02:11:04,119
..why you are here and all that.

1135
02:11:05,840 --> 02:11:10,319
Do not lie to me.

1136
02:11:10,680 --> 02:11:14,359
Elcim wouldn't have done such a thing.

1137
02:11:15,000 --> 02:11:17,799
Why didn't Konstantin kill me yet? Tell me.

1138
02:11:17,880 --> 02:11:22,279
To use you until the end.

1139
02:13:34,160 --> 02:13:37,359
So you got into my way and
became my map, Gokboru.

1140
02:13:37,640 --> 02:13:40,079
Now, both conquest..

1141
02:13:40,240 --> 02:13:42,999
..and victory awaits us.

1142
02:13:46,018 --> 02:14:01,798
Visit turkision.com for more!